---
description: >-
  Two `box` groups (one plain, one with an explicit rgb colour) plus a message
  crossing between them.
config:
  look: classic
---
sequenceDiagram
  box Group 1
    participant participant0@{ "type" : "participant" }
    participant actor1@{ "type" : "actor" }
    participant boundary2@{ "type" : "boundary" }
  end
  box rgb(200,220,255) Group 2
    participant control0@{ "type" : "control" }
    participant entity1@{ "type" : "entity" }
    participant database2@{ "type" : "database" }
  end
  participant0 ->> control0: Cross-group message
